{"nodes": [{"id": "_context_features_scheduler_feature", "label": "Feature: Scheduler / Cron jobs", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "topo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "instrumentation.ts carrega startScheduler() s\u00f3 em runtime Node; em produ\u00e7\u00e3o (Vercel serverless) o node-cron N\u00c3O dispara \u2014 quem chama \u00e9 cron externo com Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "label": "runSchedulerJobs (ordem dos jobs + SchedulerStats)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Como roda", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "confirma\u00e7\u00f5es \u2192 auto-cancelamento \u2192 markNoShows \u2192 runBillingNotifications \u2192 runBillingMaintenance \u2192 runWhatsappResilience. A rota /api/cron/run audita cron.run com as stats a cada execu\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 heartbeat consumido pelo check cron do /api/health (sem cron.run em 90 min \u2192 503). Trabalho do GCal roda por \u00faltimo com sub-budget para n\u00e3o starvar os envios nem estourar os 60s."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_send_confirmations", "label": "sendConfirmations (T-confirmationHoursBefore)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "sendConfirmations", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Filtro: confirmationSentAt null + status PENDING + user.whatsappStatus CONNECTED (+ retroactive false). Pula se cedo demais ou se j\u00e1 passou. Sem retry dedicado: falha n\u00e3o marca confirmationSentAt e a pr\u00f3xima execu\u00e7\u00e3o tenta de novo at\u00e9 markNoShows tirar do filtro."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_auto_cancel_unconfirmed", "label": "autoCancelUnconfirmed (substituiu sendReminders)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "autoCancelUnconfirmed", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No deadline (dateTime - reminderHoursBefore) quem recebeu o link e ainda est\u00e1 PENDING \u00e9 CANCELADO (+ audit appointment.auto_canceled + aviso de cortesia best-effort). Deadline \u00e9 por-tenant, ent\u00e3o varre em lotes e checa por-appointment. SchedulerStats.remindersSent virou autoCanceled."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_mark_no_shows", "label": "markNoShows (PENDING passado \u2192 NO_SHOW)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "markNoShows", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "updateMany global sem filtro por userId \u2014 aceit\u00e1vel porque o crit\u00e9rio \u00e9 universal (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 vazamento, s\u00f3 atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o)."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_retroactive_invariant", "label": "retroactive: false \u00e9 invariante do cron", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "\u26a0\ufe0f retroactive: false \u00e9 invariante", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem o filtro o cron marcaria o registro retroativo como NO_SHOW em at\u00e9 30 min e corromperia a taxa de faltas, que \u00e9 o produto. O mesmo filtro est\u00e1 na query de confirma\u00e7\u00e3o: retroativo n\u00e3o recebe WhatsApp (o atendimento j\u00e1 aconteceu) e n\u00e3o fica eternamente na fila sendo pulado pelo guard now > dateTime. Checks RT.1 (fonte) e RT.2 (DB)."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_cron_cadence_prod", "label": "Cad\u00eancia real do cron em produ\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "\u26a0\ufe0f Cad\u00eancia real em produ\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "vercel.json agenda 0 3 * * * (1\u00d7/dia, limite do plano Hobby), n\u00e3o 30 min \u2014 degrada o produto porque lembretes de janela curta nunca disparam na hora. Mitiga\u00e7\u00e3o: disparo externo a cada 15-30 min em POST /api/cron/run (muda quem chama, n\u00e3o o c\u00f3digo)."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_message_quota_gate", "label": "Gate de quota de mensagens (QUOTA_BLOCKED dedup)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Sprint 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem saldo n\u00e3o envia: cria MessageLog QUOTA_BLOCKED + audit deduplicado por (appointment, type), sen\u00e3o viraria spam a cada run. O appointment fica PENDING, ent\u00e3o upgrade antes do hor\u00e1rio faz o pr\u00f3ximo run enviar. Incremento at\u00f4mico em UsageCounter keyed por @@unique([userId, periodStart]) \u2014 n\u00e3o existe job de reset, a virada de per\u00edodo \u00e9 a cria\u00e7\u00e3o lazy de uma nova linha."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_time_budget_chunking", "label": "Chunking (200) + time-budget 45s + \u00edndices cross-tenant", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Sprint 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordenado por dateTime asc (prioriza hor\u00e1rios pr\u00f3ximos); estourou \u2192 stats.truncated e o pr\u00f3ximo run continua (enviados saem do filtro sozinhos). \u00cdndices (status, confirmationSentAt) e (status, dateTime) porque as queries do scheduler s\u00e3o cross-tenant e viravam scan global."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_timezone_format", "label": "formatInTimeZone obrigat\u00f3rio nas mensagens", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Pontos sens\u00edveis \u2192 Locale & timezone", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O runtime do Vercel \u00e9 UTC e dateTime \u00e9 instante UTC, ent\u00e3o format() puro rendiza 3h adiantado (14h \u2192 '17:00'). TZ \u00e9 env reservada no Vercel, por isso o fix \u00e9 em c\u00f3digo, n\u00e3o em env var."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_whatsapp_resilience", "label": "runWhatsappResilience (health + sweep de desconectados)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Sprint 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WhatsApp desconectado para os envios, mas desde a Sprint 8 isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 silencioso: shouldRenotifyDisconnected deduplica 24h, renotifica diariamente quando h\u00e1 agendamentos futuros (audit whatsapp.disconnected_with_pending) e mede whatsappConnectedPct."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_with_response_instruction", "label": "withResponseInstruction (instru\u00e7\u00e3o can\u00f4nica \u00e9 do sistema)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "sendConfirmations", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O template guardado \u00e9 s\u00f3 o corpo; a linha 'Responda 1 para CONFIRMAR ou 2 para CANCELAR.' \u00e9 derivada dos c\u00f3digos do webhook-parser, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 imposs\u00edvel instruir um n\u00famero que o webhook n\u00e3o aceita \u2014 corrige o bug do usu\u00e1rio instruir n\u00famero errado."}, {"id": "_context_features_scheduler_single_instance_race", "label": "Single-instance / janela de race no envio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": "Pontos sens\u00edveis", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O update de confirmationSentAt \u00e9 o mecanismo de idempot\u00eancia, mas h\u00e1 janela entre o findMany e o update; m\u00faltiplos processos podem duplicar mensagens. Produ\u00e7\u00e3o real pediria worker dedicado e/ou lock distribu\u00eddo."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_features_scheduler_feature", "target": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_scheduler_send_confirmations", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_scheduler_auto_cancel_unconfirmed", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_scheduler_mark_no_shows", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_scheduler_whatsapp_resilience", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_billing_dunning", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/scheduler.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_scheduler_run_scheduler_jobs", "target": "_context_features_billing_lifecycle_cron", "relat